title: superNOVA
abstract: >-
  Linear ideal-MHD stability of tokamak equilibria: Boozer coordinates,
  sound-Alfvén continuum and global eigenmodes on a radial B-spline
  finite-element × poloidal Fourier basis, solved with SLEPc.
